{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49547","headline":"拨櫂子 二 · 尹鹗","name":"拨櫂子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹脸腻，双靥媚。\n冠子缕金装翡翠，将一朵，琼花堪比。\n窠窠绣，鸾凤衣裳香窣地。\n银台蜡烛滴红泪，醁酒劝人教半醉。\n帘幕外，月华如水。\n特地向，宝帐颠狂不肯睡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49547.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49547","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}